# 04_Advanced-SQL-and-Data-Modeling

A retail company stores sales, customer, and product data in PostgreSQL and needs more advanced analysis for reporting and decision-making.

The engineering team must handle missing values and data types correctly, combine information from multiple related tables, calculate business metrics, and create more complex analytical queries.

Using SQL, we can work with NULL values, join tables, calculate metrics, use Common Table Expressions (CTEs), and apply window functions to analyze data efficiently.

This demonstrates how advanced SQL techniques and data modeling help transform relational data into reliable and useful business insights.

- NULL
- JOIN
- CTE
- Window 

